  lines:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b514cc97c69ba9642b655e5a906af0b8, type: 2}
    text: "\xBFHas visto c\xF3mo han adornado la plaza?"
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbc6f7ec1a982b446ba526934c0ff2e7, type: 2}
    text: "Est\xE1 m\xE1s bonita que nunca"
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62b418f5bb4446447a22dabd0a9b08f1, type: 2}
    text: "Dicen que llevan d\xEDas prepar\xE1ndolo todo."
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b514cc97c69ba9642b655e5a906af0b8, type: 2}
    text: "Normal. No todos los d\xEDas recibe el pueblo a tanta gente importante."
